|WKBSyntax: |YKBchanhist <channel> [lines]|WKB
|WKO=====================================================================
|YKOShows recent history for a channel you currently have access to. This
works with public, guild, clan, staff, and other dynamic channels according
to your current permissions and memberships.

A channel may be tuned off and still have its history reviewed. The optional
line count is limited to 300 entries.

|WKOExamples:
  |YKBchanhist gossip
  chanhist auction 50
  chanhist Street Samurai 20|XX0

|WKBSee also: |YKBchannels, tune, communication|XX0

# alias: channelhistory, channelhist
